Requires a working GPU driver and its video encoder support (VA-API on
AMD/Intel, proprietary NVIDIA driver on NVIDIA). Portal capture also needs
a running PipeWire session and a suitable xdg-desktop-portal backend.

File capabilities are not stored by this package. Direct monitor capture
uses pkexec when gsr-kms-server lacks CAP_SYS_ADMIN; install polkit and run
a graphical authentication agent, or explicitly grant the capability as root:

    setcap cap_sys_admin+ep /usr/bin/gsr-kms-server

This is a powerful capability. Reapply it after package upgrades if used.
The NVIDIA suspend workaround is not installed; see upstream documentation
if recording stops working after suspend.
